		{
			dependencies: ["5DA842A1588FB8BE"]
			description: [
				"High above the oceans of the Overworld drifts &bAcropolis&r, an ancient city suspended among the clouds and overflowing with mythological creatures."
				""
				"Built from towering seastone structures and surrounded by endless skies, this forgotten stronghold has become the domain of &3Scylla - The Ancient Storm Empress&r, a powerful entity standing between you and the path to &5The End&r."
				""
				"Will you brave the heights of &bAcropolis&r and challenge the storm itself, or fall from the skies in defeat?"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/acropolis.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you ascend deeper into the upper reaches of &bAcropolis&r, you will discover that its treasures are fiercely protected by terrifying guardians known as the &dHippocamptus&r."
				""
				"These swift and dangerous creatures patrol the city’s ancient halls, striking down any who dare plunder its riches. Defeat at least 5 Hippocamptus as you continue your climb toward the summit."
				""
				"Every step upward brings you closer to the storm."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Further within the city, you will encounter the fearsome &cClawdian&r - a colossal crab wielding a massive war hammer capable of crushing even the strongest adventurers."
				""
				"Be wary of its devastating charge attack. Use your speed potion wisely to evade its assault and create openings to strike back."
				""
				"Defeat the Clawdian and continue your ascent through the skies above."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/clawdian.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the highest point of &bAcropolis&r rests an ancient anchor, dormant and silent amidst the raging winds."
				""
				"Prepare yourself carefully, for interacting with the anchor will awaken the ruler of the storm itself. When you are ready, right-click the anchor to summon &3Scylla&r."
				""
				"In an explosion of thunder and lightning, Scylla will descend from the skies to challenge you in a furious battle."
				""
				"Only by defeating her can you obtain the &bEssence of Storm&r, a fragment of Scylla’s immense power. This rare material is required to forge the &3Aetheric Eye&r, bringing you one step closer to unlocking &5The End&r."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_1.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"Learn more on the next page."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Scylla commands the fury of the storm itself, wielding powerful lightning and tidal attacks capable of overwhelming unprepared adventurers."
				""
				"Be especially cautious of her wave attack. If struck, you will receive the &9Wetness&r debuff, greatly increasing the damage taken from her lightning abilities. You can avoid or block this attack using shields or nearby blocks for cover."
				""
				"Stay mobile, watch the skies, and prepare for a relentless battle."
				""
				"Good luck. You will need it."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_2.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
