		{
			dependencies: ["5DA842A1588FB8BE"]
			description: [
				"In &cNether Remastered&r, access to the Nether is no longer achieved through a standard obsidian portal. Instead, entry is tied to a progression system inspired by &5End Remastered&r, transforming the Nether from an early-game destination into a meaningful milestone on your journey."
				""
				"To unlock the dimension, you must explore the Overworld, conquer structures, and gather the components required to craft the &6Seal of the Underworld&r. Only by consuming this powerful artifact can the gateway be opened."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPreparing the Seal&r"
				""
				"Crafting the &6Seal of the Underworld&r requires several unique components obtained through exploration and adventure."
				""
				"The most important tool for this journey is the &6Structure Compass&r. Many of the required materials are hidden within specific structures scattered throughout the Overworld, and the Structure Compass can greatly assist in locating them."
				""
				"Several components, including the various &dMysterious Shards&r required for progression, can all be found within the loot chests of these key structures."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Other ingredients can also be discovered through exploration."
				""
				"The &5Nether Crystal&r can be found within the chests of any &dHopo Portal&r structure, while &bChromatic Compound&r can be discovered in the loot chests of many Create-themed structures throughout the world."
				""
				"One of the most important crafting components is the &6Deployer&r, which serves as a gateway into Sequenced Assembly. While Deployers can be crafted normally, they can also be found as loot within many Create-themed structures, allowing explorers to begin progression much sooner."
				""
				"Likewise, &6Crushing Wheels&r required for Electrum production can frequently be discovered as structure loot."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Another key ingredient is &cBottled Nether Essence&r."
				""
				"To obtain it, place an &8Obsidian Infused Bottle&r in your offhand and defeat undead creatures. As they fall, their lingering essence will be captured within the bottle, providing the material required to complete the Seal."
				""
				"You will also need access to &6Electrum&r, which can be obtained through processing chains involving crushed Tuff and other materials. Crushing Wheels discovered during exploration can greatly simplify this process."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Once inside, the Nether has been dramatically expanded through multiple mods, introducing new biomes, enhanced terrain generation, and dangerous structures filled with valuable rewards."
				""
				"These additions provide new opportunities for resource gathering, brewing ingredients, automation progression, and exploration. The dimension now features unique environmental hazards, challenging enemies, and valuable loot that cannot be found elsewhere."
				""
				"Success will require preparation, planning, and the ability to adapt to an increasingly hostile environment."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"The reimagined Nether is no longer a simple travel destination."
				""
				"It is a test of exploration, progression, and survival. The resources and knowledge gained here will provide the foundation for future engineering projects, dimensional advancement, and your eventual journey to the stars."
				""
				"{image:nether_remastered:textures/nether_remastered.png width:100 height:100 align:center}"
			]
