		{
			dependencies: ["7E64EF50D212B5C5"]
			description: [
				"Glittering with the allure of the unknown, the &bAetheric Eye&r has guided countless explorers to their destinies-some to treasures hidden within the &eCataclysm Acropolis&r, others to fates lost beneath its storm-shrouded halls."
				"It shimmers with elemental power and whispers of secrets long drowned by the tides."
				""
				"The Aetheric Eye is not gifted by fortune-it must be claimed through strength, sacrifice, and mastery of the storm."
				"The following pages will reveal the path to awakening its shimmering light."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"&lEssence of the Storm&r:"
				"The raw breath of a sea tempest, ripped from the heart of &eScylla&r-the guardian of the Acropolis."
				"Only by defeating this monstrous horror can you harvest the &eEssence of the Storm&r, a keystone in the Eye’s awakening."
				"{image:ftb:textures/scylla_2.png width:200 height:125 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEye of Storm&r:"
				"Born not in battle, but through artifice."
				"A &eSequenced Assembly&r upon an &eEye of Ender&r will reveal it, using:"
				""
				"A &eConduit&r,"
				""
				"A &eSea Lantern&r,"
				""
				"Washed in &eSpouting Water&r,"
				""
				"Then sealed with the press of automation."
				"{image:cataclysm:item/storm_eye width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lLacrima&r:"
				"Crystallized sorrow shed by the Acropolis itself."
				"It may be uncovered within its storm-drowned chests, or torn from the essence of any creature that dares to lurk within its halls."
				"{image:cataclysm:item/lacrima width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lUndead Soul&r:"
				"A whisper of the drowned, bound within the Acropolis’s cursed warriors."
				"This essence is all that remains of those claimed by the sea, and it answers only to those who strike them down."
				"{image:endrem:item/undead_soul width:100 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nThe storm keeps its secrets-but you must seize them.&r"
				"The Aetheric Eye glimmers not for the timid, but for those who conquer the wrath of the Acropolis and bind its relics into their command."
				"Only the bold who withstand the sea’s fury will awaken its guiding light."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:exotic_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
