		{
			dependencies: ["7E64EF50D212B5C5"]
			description: [
				"Shrouded in enigmatic energies, the &5Cryptic Eye&r is a relic that whispers truths no mortal was ever meant to know.  "
				"Its gaze pierces the veil of reality itself, unraveling forgotten secrets and forbidden knowledge.  "
				""
				"Unlike other relics, the Cryptic Eye cannot simply be found-it must be awakened through a ritual of focus, knowledge, and risk. "
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&nBut beware&r-this ritual stirs forces beyond comprehension.  "
				"The Cryptic Eye does not merely reveal hidden truths-it tests the will of those who seek to wield them.  "
				"Only the wise, the patient, and the daring will endure its gaze and emerge with knowledge once thought lost forever."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:cryptic_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
			id: "0D9A77A2F4BA4951"
			optional: true
			rewards: [
