		{
			dependencies: ["765B4C05B9DEDC12"]
			description: [
				"Imbued with the brilliance of ancient minds, the &6Rogue Eye&r is a relic that once illuminated the birth of Redstone itself.  "
				"It hums softly with the ingenuity and daring of a bygone age-an artifact meant for those bold enough to reforge its legacy.  "
				""
				"Unlike other relics torn from battle or myth, the Rogue Eye is crafted through the spark of invention and the relentless pursuit of progress.  "
				"The pages ahead will guide you through the path of innovation."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lPrecision Mechanism&r:   "
				"  Each Mechanism is created via Sequenced Assembly, where a Gold Sheet is looped five times through:  "
				"  - Applying a &eGold Nugget&r  "
				"  - Applying a &eCogwheel&r  "
				"  - Applying a &eLarge Cogwheel&r  "
				"  Precision, patience, and a mastery of automation are key.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/mechanism.png width:150 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lBrass Block&r:  "
				"  A gleaming testament to progress, a Brass Block is formed by gathering &e9 Brass Ingots&r.  "
				"  Create Brass Ingots through Heated Mixing, combining a &eCopper Ingot&r and a &eZinc Ingot&r to yield two brilliant ingots of brass.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/brass.png width:50 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"- &lMithril Ingot&r:  "
				"  A rare alloy, glowing with inner vitality and strength.  "
				"  Mithril is obtained by Superheated Mixing, combining:  "
				"  - &eSteel&r  "
				"  - &eChromatic Compound&r  "
				"  - &eGlowberry Milkshake&r  "
				"  - &eXP Nuggets&r  "
				"  This fusion of metal, light, and experience yields a material unlike any other.  "
				"{image:ftb:textures/mithril.png width:200 height:100 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &nIngenuity is the beating heart of the Rogue Eye.&r  "
				"To awaken its brilliance, you must master both machine and mind-welding together the achievements of creation to honor the first sparks that gave rise to Redstone itself.  "
				"Only true inventors will succeed in forging this symbol of progress and legacy."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "endrem:rogue_eye"
				tag: {
					Damage: 0
				}
			}
