		{
			dependencies: ["47199DA52BCB4384"]
			description: [
				"Hidden in the depths of Luminous Nether biomes, the &6Scorchia Vent&r burns with dormant potential. This ore stone is essential for automating &8Coal&r, offering a renewable supply of fuel for all your industrial ambitions."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/scorchia_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To awaken this fiery titan, locate a &lScorchia Vent&r in any Regions Unexplored Biome and &lfeed a blaze burner a blaze cake on top of it&r. The resulting transformation tears through its brittle shell, converting it into an active vent ready to accept molten fluid."
				""
				"Once activated, channel &dHot Chocolate&r into the vent. With the help of &lMechanical Extruders&r, you'll unlock a stable and automated source of coal-fueled by the Nether’s own wrath."
				""
				" &8Coal, reborn from magma-forge your fuel empire from the flames.&r"
			]
			icon: "create_resource_vents:dormant_scorchia_vent"
			id: "10D2ED18910A5579"
			rewards: [
