		{
			dependencies: ["47199DA52BCB4384"]
			description: [
				"Deep within the Region's Unexplored Nether Biomes lies the &8Debris Vent&r-a molten geyser brimming with the raw essence of ancient strength. This precious ore stone is your key to automating the collection of &cAncient Debris&r, the foundation of Netherite itself."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/debris_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To begin, seek out a &lDebris Vent&r in any Luminous Nether Biome-its dormant core still untouched by time. Place &la blaze burner&r atop its surface and feed it blaze cake to shatter the vent's seal, awakening it for automation."
				""
				"Once activated, it’s time to channel &dsource fluid&r into the vent. With the help of &lMechanical Extruders&r, you’ll forge an endless supply of Ancient Debris-crafted not by pickaxe, but by innovation."
				""
				" &cThe Nether remembers. Now, so will your machines.&r"
			]
