		{
			dependencies: ["79B13E9FA5446394"]
			description: [
				"&7Fuel your rocket and prepare for the ultimate lunar adventure.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, astronaut-you’ve built the &fTier 1 Rocket&r, and your path to the stars is finally clear! Now it’s time to bring that rocket to life and &lignite your first launch&r."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				" &lFueling the Dream&r:  "
				"Before liftoff, you’ll need to fuel your rocket. Grab a bucket of &eFuel&r and right-click the rocket’s tank while it’s sitting on the launch pad. Once your ship is full and your gear is secured, climb in, look to the stars, and &lhold down the spacebar&r."
				""
				" As the engines roar to life, you’ll feel the power of your creation carrying you through the atmosphere and into the great beyond."
				""
				" The Moon awaits-but it’s only the beginning."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				"Fuel is crafted by heated mixing oil as shown below:"
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/_forge_frontier_mixing_oil_fuel.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
			]
			icon: "ad_astra:moon_globe"
