		{
			dependencies: ["3F3994EDD215FC99"]
			description: [
				"&7Every great journey begins with a single launch. Before you can leave the Overworld behind and set foot among the stars, you must first construct the &fTier 1 Rocket&r—the foundation of humanity's expansion into space."
				""
				"Building this rocket is more than a crafting task. It is the culmination of everything you have learned so far, from resource gathering and automation to machinery and material processing."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lConstructing Your First Rocket&r"
				""
				"The Tier 1 Rocket is assembled from a variety of specialized components, each representing a different stage of technological progression. From reinforced structural parts to advanced engineering systems, every piece plays a vital role in preparing your spacecraft for launch."
				""
				"Many of these components require automation, processing chains, and Create machinery to produce efficiently."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes and production requirements for all rocket parts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the final components come together and your rocket stands assembled upon the launch pad, a new reality begins to take shape."
				""
				"Your machines are no longer serving a simple factory."
				""
				"They are fueling a space program."
			]
			hide_dependency_lines: true
			hide_dependent_lines: true
