		{
			dependencies: ["7964AB0D39902EFA"]
			description: [
				"The void winds of &5The End&r carry whispers of a forgotten fortress drifting among the islands."
				""
				"Known as the &8Ruined Citadel&r, this ancient stronghold stands as one of the greatest challenges within the End. Its shattered walls conceal vast treasures, powerful relics, and a guardian whose strength rivals even the mightiest foes encountered throughout your journey."
				""
				"Many adventurers have entered seeking glory."
				""
				"Few have ever returned."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ruined_citadel.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As you explore the ruined halls of the &8Ruined Citadel&r, you will discover immense riches hidden among its crumbling corridors."
				""
				"Treasure chests filled with valuable equipment line the fortress, while blocks of gold and diamond remain scattered throughout the structure, untouched for centuries."
				""
				"Yet such wealth does not go unprotected."
				""
				"The Citadel is patrolled by powerful &5Ender Golems&r, ancient constructs tasked with guarding its secrets against intruders. Loot what you can, but remain vigilant."
				""
				"Every corridor brings you closer to the fortress's true master."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ruined_citadel_loot.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Deeper within the Citadel, one of the ancient guardians will awaken to challenge your advance."
				""
				"The &5Ender Golem&r is a formidable opponent capable of delivering devastating attacks while defending the heart of the fortress. Defeat it to prove your worth and continue your journey into the depths of the Citadel."
				""
				"Upon its defeat, the guardian will relinquish a &dVoid Core&r, a rare artifact infused with the energy of the End itself and a vital ingredient in advanced rocket construction."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ender_golem.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"At the heart of the &8Ruined Citadel&r awaits the fortress's final protector: the &5Ender Guardian&r."
				""
				"This colossal warrior has stood watch over the Citadel for ages beyond memory, crushing all who dared challenge its authority. To claim the Citadel's greatest treasures, you must defeat it."
				""
				"The Guardian wields immense power. It can launch you into the air, charge across the arena with incredible force, and summon destructive Void Runes that erupt with volatile energy."
				""
				"As the battle progresses, the very arena itself will begin to collapse. At half health, the Guardian will shatter the floor beneath your feet, dragging the fight into the ruins below where the battle continues."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ender_guardian.png width:200 height:120 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Only by defeating the &5Ender Guardian&r can you claim the legendary &dGauntlet of the Guard&r."
				""
				"This powerful relic serves as one of the final components required to construct the &6Tier 5 Rocket&r, opening the path beyond the End and into the strange worlds that await among the stars."
				""
				"Stand your ground. Watch for the Guardian's attacks. Survive the collapse of the arena."
				""
				"The future of your journey depends on it."
			]
			icon: {
				Count: 1
				id: "cataclysm:void_eye"
				tag: { }
			}
