		{
			dependencies: ["22ADB76FDC911F77"]
			description: [
				"These stone-white relics rest in stillness across the void, untouched by time yet filled with untapped potential. The &fVent&r -while seemingly inert-is one of the final pieces in your industrial arsenal."
				""
