		{
			dependencies: ["4669B8B378A79459"]
			description: [
				"Hidden deep within the Blooming Caverns of the Otherside, the &dResonite Vent&r shimmers faintly with ethereal energy. This ancient ore stone is the key to producing the elusive &9Echo Shards&r used in powerful late-game recipes and technologies."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/resonite_vent.png width:175 height:175 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To unleash its potential, locate a &lDormant Resonite Vent&r in the Otherside. Consider using Freecam to locate the vertical column of vent fluid. Feed a blaze burner blaze cake atop its core to awaken the ancient signal buried deep within."
				""
				"Once activated, supply it with &dresonarium&r to channel its energy through &lMechanical Extruders&r. Watch as the Resonite pulses to life, converting sound and soul into Echo Shards with mechanical precision."
