		{
			dependencies: ["638EF7DB16108237"]
			description: [
				"&7Beneath the Overworld lies a forgotten civilization swallowed by darkness. The ruins they left behind hold powerful relics, dangerous secrets, and the key to reaching an entirely new dimension.&r"
				""
				"The &5Deeper and Darker&r progression begins within the Deep Dark, where ancient structures and mysterious technology await those brave enough to descend into the darkness."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAncient City&r"
				""
				"Hidden deep beneath the Overworld, the &8Ancient City&r stands as the first major step into Deeper and Darker progression."
				""
				"These vast underground ruins are filled with valuable loot, rare resources, and clues surrounding the mysterious portal frame found at their center. As you explore, you will encounter powerful Sculk-infested threats and the terrifying &0Warden&r itself."
				""
				"Defeating the Warden and claiming its heart is essential for unlocking the path forward."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ancient_city_screenshot.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAncient Temple&r"
				""
				"Beyond the portal lies the &5Otherside&r, a mysterious dimension unlike anything found within the Overworld."
				""
				"Scattered throughout this strange realm are &5Ancient Temples&r, massive structures containing valuable treasures, unique resources, and powerful artifacts unavailable anywhere else. Among their rewards is the rare &dSculk Transmitter&r, a component required for some of the most advanced technologies in the pack."
				""
				"Exploration of these temples will reward those willing to brave the dangers of the Otherside."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/otherside_screenshot.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"To access the Otherside, you must first defeat the &0Warden&r within an Ancient City."
				""
				"Once defeated, place the Warden's Heart into the dormant portal frame found at the center of the city. The ancient gateway will awaken, granting passage into a realm forgotten by time."
				""
				"What awaits beyond is up to you to discover."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/otherside_portal.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
			]
