		{
			dependencies: ["7964AB0D39902EFA"]
			description: [
				"&7The End is far more than a barren wasteland of floating islands. Scattered throughout the void are the remnants of forgotten civilizations, abandoned outposts, and mysterious structures filled with powerful loot and rare materials.&r"
				""
				"Exploration is a critical part of End progression. Many valuable resources, unique equipment, and rare crafting ingredients can only be found within these ancient ruins."
				""
				"Those willing to venture into the void will be richly rewarded."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAncient End Tower&r"
				""
				"Rising above the islands of the End, the &5Ancient End Tower&r stands as a relic of a civilization long lost to time."
				""
				"These towering structures contain valuable loot, rare resources, and dangerous defenders guarding their treasures. Adventurers who reach the upper levels will often find rewards worthy of the journey."
				""
				"Explore carefully—many dangers lurk within the tower's halls."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/ancient_end_tower.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEnd Ships&r"
				""
				"Drifting through the void are abandoned vessels left behind by forgotten explorers."
				""
				"Both the &dFlying End Ship&r and the corrupted &5Warped Flying End Ship&r contain valuable loot, rare equipment, and resources useful throughout End progression. Their isolated locations make them difficult to reach, but the rewards often justify the risk."
				""
				"The void below offers little forgiveness to those who fall."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/flying_end_ship.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lEnd City&r"
				""
				"The iconic &5End City&r remains one of the most valuable structures found throughout The End."
				""
				"Its towering spires contain enchanted equipment, rare materials, and treasures useful for both exploration and progression. Powerful Shulkers defend these ancient cities, making preparation essential before attempting to raid them."
				""
				"Many adventurers make their fortune within these towering ruins."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/end_city.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lWarped Station&r"
				""
				"Among the strangest structures in the End is the &5Warped Station&r, a mysterious outpost suspended within the void."
				""
				"Little remains of its original inhabitants, but valuable loot and resources can still be found within its abandoned halls. These stations serve as excellent locations for gathering supplies while exploring the outer islands."
				""
				"No one knows who built them—or why they were abandoned."
				""
				"{image:ftb:textures/warped_station.png width:225 height:140 align:center}"
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Each of these structures contains unique loot, resources, and opportunities for progression."
				""
				"Whether you're searching for equipment, rare crafting ingredients, or simply seeking adventure among the stars, exploration of The End is highly encouraged."
				""
				"The void holds many secrets."
				""
				"All that remains is for you to discover them."
			]
