		{
			dependencies: ["7964AB0D39902EFA"]
			description: [
				"&7With both &5The End&r and &bGlacio&r conquered, a new frontier emerges beyond the known reaches of the Ad Astra solar system.&r"
				""
				"The construction of the &dTier 5 Rocket&r marks the beginning of a completely new chapter in your adventure. Built using materials gathered from End exploration, powerful bosses, and the frozen landscapes of Glacio, this spacecraft serves as the gateway to worlds unlike anything encountered before."
				""
				"What lies ahead is no longer traditional space exploration."
				""
				"It is the exploration of entirely new realms."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lConstructing the Tier 5 Rocket&r"
				""
				"The Tier 5 Rocket is assembled using advanced components obtained through both End and Glacio progression. Many of its parts require rare materials, boss drops, specialized machinery, and extensive automation networks to produce."
				""
				"By this stage, your factory should be capable of handling complex production chains spanning multiple dimensions and planets."
				""
				"Need help crafting a specific rocket component?"
				""
				"Consult &6JEI&r for detailed recipes, ingredient requirements, and production chains for all rocket parts."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Upon completing the Tier 5 Rocket, you will unlock access to the first three &6Alex's Caves&r planets:"
				""
				"* &1Abyssal Chasm&r"
				"* &6Primordial Caves&r"
				"* &8Forlorn Hollows&r"
				""
				"Each world offers unique resources, dangerous creatures, powerful structures, and progression opportunities unavailable anywhere else."
				""
				"Prepare carefully before departure."
				""
				"These worlds operate by their own rules."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"As the launch sequence begins and your newest spacecraft rises from the pad, you leave the familiar solar system behind."
				""
				"The Moon, Mars, Mercury, Venus, Glacio, and The End have prepared you for this moment."
				""
				"Now, the true unknown awaits."
				""
				"Your journey into Alex's Caves begins here."
			]
