		{
			dependencies: ["699FEE9775A89BE5"]
			description: [
				"&7With the &dTier 5 Rocket&r complete, your journey expands beyond the familiar worlds of Ad Astra and into entirely new frontiers.&r"
				""
				"Congratulations, explorer! You have unlocked access to the first three &6Alex's Caves&r planets: &1Abyssal Chasm&r, &6Primordial Caves&r, and &8Forlorn Hollows&r. These worlds are unlike anything encountered throughout the solar system, each containing unique ecosystems, powerful resources, dangerous creatures, and progression opportunities that cannot be found anywhere else."
				""
				"A new era of exploration begins now."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lAbyssal Chasm&r"
				""
				"Beneath endless oceans and crushing depths lies the &1Abyssal Chasm&r, a world consumed by darkness and ancient aquatic life."
				""
				"Those willing to brave its depths will discover:"
				""
				"* &oUnique underwater environments&r unlike any previous planet."
				"* &oRare resources&r required for advanced progression."
				"* &oAncient structures&r hidden beneath the waters."
				"* &oPowerful creatures&r lurking within the abyss."
				""
				"The deeper you descend, the greater the rewards—and the dangers."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lPrimordial Caves&r"
				""
				"Step into a lost world where prehistoric life still roams the land."
				""
				"Throughout the &6Primordial Caves&r, you will encounter:"
				""
				"* &oAncient creatures&r from a forgotten age."
				"* &oPowerful resources&r unavailable anywhere else."
				"* &oUnique structures&r hidden throughout the wilderness."
				"* Dangerous encounters with some of the largest creatures in the pack."
				""
				"Survival here requires caution, preparation, and respect for the ancient world around you."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"&lForlorn Hollows&r"
				""
				"Shrouded in darkness and mystery, the &8Forlorn Hollows&r is a realm where strange creatures and ancient horrors dwell."
				""
				"Within this haunting world you will find:"
				""
				"* &oRare materials&r used in advanced crafting."
				"* &oUnique structures&r filled with valuable loot."
				"* &oPowerful enemies&r guarding hidden secrets."
				"* Progression opportunities essential for future rocket construction."
				""
				"Many enter the Hollows seeking treasure. Not all return."
				""
				"{@pagebreak}"
				""
				"Abyssal Chasm, Primordial Caves, and Forlorn Hollows represent the next major stage of your adventure."
				""
				"Their resources will unlock powerful new technologies, their dangers will challenge even experienced explorers, and their secrets will pave the way toward the worlds that still remain undiscovered."
				""
				"The stars no longer mark the end of your journey."
				""
				"They were only the beginning."
			]
